00:32:38.790 --> 00:32:42.493
But I think it's a really
good way to capture

00:32:42.493 --> 00:32:45.330
the efficiency and the
use of the actual weapon.

00:32:45.330 --> 00:32:47.131
So, I don't know, 9.

